  <rdf:Description rdf:nodeID="commodity_laneret_cb0">
    <crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>the male of the lanner, a species of falcon, found in countries bordering on the Mediterranean (Falco lanarius or F. feldeggi) (OED s.v. lanner, lanneret)</crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>
